<html xmlns:o="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:office" xmlns:w="urn:schemas-microsoft-com:office:word" xmlns="http://www.w3.org/TR/REC-html40"><head><meta charset="utf-8"><meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1"><title>PARAMASA DHE PARALLOGARIA – Pjesa e përbashkët</title><!--[if gte mso 9]><xml><w:WordDocument><w:View>Print</w:View><w:Zoom>100</w:Zoom></w:WordDocument></xml><![endif]--><style>
